---
// Approved Living Systems composition; native Astro, no client framework.

---
<section class="ls-visual-episode ls-container is-reversed">
<div class="ls-episode-copy">
<p class="ls-eyebrow">THE RESULT AND THE REASONS</p>
<h2>READ THE ANSWER.<br/>
<span class="ls-stroke">OPEN THE RECEIPT.</span>
</h2>
<div class="ls-episode-dek">
<p>See the run, model, locality, observed cost, checks and evidence. Follow a saved revision to its exact diff. Sources read and evidence assessed stay distinct; uncertainty stays visible.</p>
</div>
<a class="ls-text-link" href="/flow/receipts/">Explore receipts and evidence<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</a>
</div>
<figure aria-label="The answer has a history" class="ls-scene ls-receipt-scene" data-frame="0" data-scene="true" data-scene-count="4">
<div class="ls-scene-chrome">
<span>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
</span>
<b>The answer has a history</b>
<span>FLOW / ILLUSTRATION</span>
</div>
<div class="ls-scene-body">
<div class="ls-receipt-layout">
<div class="ls-receipt-timeline">
<button aria-pressed="true" data-scene-select="0" type="button">
<i>1</i>
<span>
<b>Revision</b>
<small>Exact changes + restore</small>
</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-scene-select="1" type="button">
<i>2</i>
<span>
<b>Route</b>
<small>Model · provider · locality</small>
</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-scene-select="2" type="button">
<i>3</i>
<span>
<b>Checks</b>
<small>Passed, failed or unresolved</small>
</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-scene-select="3" type="button">
<i>4</i>
<span>
<b>Evidence</b>
<small>Claims, coverage + uncertainty</small>
</span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</div>
<div class="ls-receipt-detail">
<span class="ls-output-label">SAMPLE RECEIPT / TEAM STATUS</span>
<h3>Something you can inspect.</h3>
<dl data-scene-panel="0">
<div>
<dt>Changed part</dt>
<dd>Launch status table</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Before → after</dt>
<dd>4/8 → 6/8</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>History</dt>
<dd>Saved revision + exact diff</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<dl data-scene-panel="1" hidden="">
<div>
<dt>Run</dt>
<dd>Local Overnight note</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Locality</dt>
<dd>On this Mac</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Provider charge</dt>
<dd>No hosted-model charge</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<dl data-scene-panel="2" hidden="">
<div>
<dt>Count matches source</dt>
<dd>Passed</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Editorial completeness</dt>
<dd>Not assessed</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Meaning</dt>
<dd>Uncertainty stays visible</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<dl data-scene-panel="3" hidden="">
<div>
<dt>Source read</dt>
<dd>team / launch.md</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Supported claim</dt>
<dd>6 tasks complete</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Interpretation</dt>
<dd>Still yours to judge</dd>
</div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ls-scene-controls">
<span class="ls-scene-status">
<span data-scene-caption="0">01 / The revision</span>
<span data-scene-caption="1" hidden="">02 / The route</span>
<span data-scene-caption="2" hidden="">03 / The checks</span>
<span data-scene-caption="3" hidden="">04 / The evidence</span>
</span>
<span>
<button aria-label="Next step: The answer has a history" data-scene-next="true" type="button">Next <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-label="Replay: The answer has a history" data-scene-replay="true" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8">
</path>
<path d="M3 3v5h5">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
